 "```lean\ncase vc1\nxs : Array Nat\n⊢ 0 ≤ xs.size\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc5\nxs : Array Nat\nb✝ mb✝ : Nat\na✝ :\n  (Variant.ofMeasure fun x =>\n          match x with\n          | (fst, a) => xs.size - a).EvalsTo\n      (none, b✝) mb✝ ⊓\n    match (none, b✝) with\n    | (fst, i) => i ≤ xs.size\nh✝¹ : b✝ < xs.size\nh✝ : ¬xs[b✝]! = 0\ni : Nat := b✝ + 1\n⊢ i ≤ xs.size\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc6\nxs : Array Nat\nb✝ mb✝ : Nat\na✝ :\n  (Variant.ofMeasure fun x =>\n          match x with\n          | (fst, a) => xs.size - a).EvalsTo\n      (none, b✝) mb✝ ⊓\n    match (none, b✝) with\n    | (fst, i) => i ≤ xs.size\nh✝ : ¬b✝ < xs.size\n⊢ b✝ ≤ xs.size\n```",
